		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>GlassFolders 0.7.4 Beta 3.6</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Beta 3.6 保留已经验证成功的 App Library 命中逻辑，不再开放资源库百分比强度。资源库改为 Clear / Liquid Glass 两套固定材质和各自三个预设；搜索框与分类卡片自动使用同一套材质。普通文件夹 Clear / Liquid Glass 不变。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>风格</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Clear：颜色只来自真实壁纸/backdrop，不添加紫、蓝、粉等彩色 tint。Clear 本身从最低强度就保持干净透亮；强度提高时主要增加模糊、色彩分离与边缘/高光结构，而不是明显增加白色透光。Liquid Glass：浅色关闭态更克制、更少发白；打开态更透明、更少灰雾，并用方向性高光和局部折射感突出玻璃。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Style</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>Clear</string>
				<string>Liquid Glass</string>
			</array>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Clear 强度</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>只用于 Clear。0% 已经保持高透亮/低灰雾，只是不额外增加局部模糊与结构；往上主要增加 Gaussian 模糊、颜色/层次分离和边缘高光，100% 打开态仍约 40pt。透亮本身只做小幅变化，避免低档闷灰、高档又只是变白。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
